{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:53+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T16:57:53+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Infrastrutture Wireless Italiane S.p.A.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"Real Estate Services","country":"Italy","city":"Rome","website":"https://www.inwit.it","employees":345,"summary":"Infrastrutture Wireless Italiane S.p.A. operates in the electronic communications infrastructure sector in Italy. The company builds and manages digital and shared infrastructure elements, that hosts logic, the radio equipment of mobile, fixed wireless access (FWA), and IoT markets. Its infrastructure includes integrated ecosystem of tower infrastructure, such as towers, poles, masts, related technology systems, gateways, IoT sensors, fibre, and land; smart infrastructure comprising distributed antenna systems (DAS) antennas, small cells, and repeaters; and real estate infrastructure, including land and production of renewable energy. In addition, the company provides indoor and outdoor coverage services through small cells and distributed antenna system to operators and owners of public and private buildings multi-operator infrastructures, as well as in the tests technologies to support operators; and hosting and connectivity services. It serves mobile network operators; fixed wireless access operators; broadcasting service operators; utilities; and institutions, public bodies, and armed forces. Infrastrutture Wireless Italiane S.p.A. was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Rome, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Infrastrutture Wireless Italiane S.p.A. opère dans le secteur des infrastructures de communications électroniques en Italie. La société construit et gère des éléments d'infrastructure numérique et partagée, qui hébergent la logique, les équipements radio des marchés mobiles, de l'accès sans fil fixe (FWA) et de l'IoT. Son infrastructure comprend un écosystème intégré d'infrastructures de tours, telles que des tours, des poteaux, des mâts, des systèmes technologiques connexes, des passerelles, des capteurs IoT, des fibres et des terrains; une infrastructure intelligente comprenant des antennes de systèmes d'antennes distribuées (DAS), de petites cellules et des répéteurs; et une infrastructure immobilière, y compris des terres et la production d'énergie renouvelable."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":6678431744,"shares_outstanding":902490748,"trailing_pe":20.555555,"forward_pe":20.91991,"price_to_book":2.1436849,"ev_to_ebitda":16.212,"ev_to_revenue":11.483,"dividend_yield":0.076,"payout_ratio":1.4808,"beta_yahoo":0.834},"targets":{"current_price":7.4,"mean":7.58824,"median":7.2,"high":9.3,"low":6.5,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":2.5625,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-11"],"eps_avg":0.09678,"eps_low":0.09678,"eps_high":0.09678,"revenue_avg":266973410,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.70614,"institutions_pct":0.16319999,"institutions_float_pct":0.55537,"institutions_n":194,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0005,"shares":409418,"value":3029693,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.1671}],"funds":[{"name":"LAZARD FUNDS INC-Lazard Global Listed Infrastructure Portfolio","pct":0.048499998,"shares":43828449,"value":324330526,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1099},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.005,"shares":4537638,"value":33578521,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0293},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0033000002,"shares":2998952,"value":22192245,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0199},{"name":"Cohen & Steers Infrastructure Fund Inc","pct":0.0032,"shares":2866509,"value":21212166,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.8667},{"name":"Virtus Opportunities Trust-Virtus KAR International Small-Mid Cap Fund",